    "answer": {
      "short": "A negative dot product requires an obtuse angle, so the angle cannot be $30^\\circ$.",
      "worked": "$$\\mathbf a\\cdot\\mathbf b=|\\mathbf a||\\mathbf b|\\cos\\theta.$$\n\nFor this expression to be negative, $\\cos\\theta$ must be negative, so $\\theta$ cannot be acute. A negative dot product requires an obtuse angle, whereas $30^\\circ$ is acute.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
